# prisma-installed agent skills: .claude/ and .windsurf/ are meant to be symlinks to .agents/skills,
# but this git checkout has core.symlinks=false, so `git add` would dereference them and store full
# duplicate copies. Keep .agents/skills as the single committed copy.
/.claude/skills
/.windsurf/skills
